OL,3,AWill Trump's AI rebrand to 'super
OL,4,Aintelligence' catch on?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump says the term
OL,7,Fartificial intelligence (AI) makes the
OL,8,Ftechnology "sound fake" and wants it to
OL,9,Fbe called "super intelligence".
OL,11,F"Welcome to the new world of super
OL,12,Fintelligence - SI," Trump said during a
OL,13,Fwide-ranging speech to the United
OL,14,FNations General Assembly in New York on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
